    kind: work_item  # d6b6
    title: "next concept audit input: sweep for facts two consumers derive separately and disagree on (dead vs test-only, classified vs starved, sketch vs compact top symbols, profile vs pass file counts); single-source each or pin agreement with a property test"  # d6b6
    status: todo_hard  # d6b6
    priority: 3  # d6b6
    parent:  # d6b6
