  message: "Not a duplicate of INV-tabaf (an overlay completeness grant's disclosure), INV-titid (compact's features array pointing at pruned nodes: ONE output inconsistent with itself, not two consumers disagreeing) or WI-finij (silence_reason values with no producer); the tracker's SimHash flagged all three at 8 bits. Companions: WI-kosup (audit #20's input, done), WI-tilav (subset-partition gate), WI-ziruv (axiom falsification, done)."  # e2fb
